"""RingBack unit tests — standard library only.

Coverage: database (masking included), on-disk persistence, missed-appointment
detection, call simulation (validated schema), scheduler safety locks, input
validation, CSV import, ICS calendar import (folded lines, dates with/without
time zone, no-number), `first yes` cascade (stops at the first yes, spared
contacts never called, list exhausted), smart move (the old appointment marked
`deplace`, a new one created), web server (including the `Call queue` and
`Cascade` pages), and the real AppelReel client exercised against a LOCAL FAKE
CALL-E API (http.server) — the real API is NEVER contacted.
"""

